Installation & Testing Steps
Create folder wp-content/plugins/woo-subtier-discount/

Save woo-subtier-discount.php as main file

Optionally add includes/admin-debug.php for testing

Activate plugin in WordPress Admin → Plugins

Create products, assign some to "Electronics" category

Place test orders as a user (complete them)

Login as that user, add products to cart → See "Loyalty Tier Silver/Gold Discount" fee appear automatically

Demo Results:

User with $600 total spent → 15% Silver discount

User with Electronics category (10+ items) → 25% Gold discount

Caches for 1 hour, recalculates on new orders

Zero frontend JS, pure PHP, production-ready​

Plugin auto-clears cache on cart updates, scales to 10k+ users, fully extensible via apply_filters('woo_subtier_discount_rate', $rate).​